      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Illustrious Ultimate Upscale\n\n1. **Generate** with an Illustrious checkpoint at SDXL size (832x1216 here).\n2. **Ultimate SD Upscale** enlarges it with the upscale model, then repaints it tile by tile with the same checkpoint and prompts.\n\n- **upscale_by** 2 gives 1664x2432. 3 or 4 works on a big GPU; it only takes longer.\n- **denoise** 0.3-0.4 adds detail and keeps the picture. Above 0.5 tiles start to invent things.\n- **tile_width / height** 1024: Illustrious is trained at 1024, so tiles that size look best.\n- **Upscaler:** 4x-AnimeSharp for anime / illustration, 4x-UltraSharp for painterly or 2.5D.\n- **seam_fix_mode:** leave None; try Band Pass if tile edges show.\n"
      ]
    }
